#: ../../library/cmath.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`cmath` --- mathematical functions for complex numbers"
msgstr ":mod:`cmath` --- matematiska funktioner för komplexa tal"

#: ../../library/cmath.rst:7
msgid ""
"The :mod:`cmath` module provides basic mathematical functions for working "
"with complex numbers, including trigonometric, exponential, logarithmic, and"
" conversions between rectangular ``(real, imag)`` and polar ``(r, phi)`` "
"representations."
msgstr ""
"Modulen :mod:`cmath` tillhandahåller grundläggande matematiska funktioner "
"för arbete med komplexa tal, inklusive trigonometriska, exponentiella och "
"logaritmiska funktioner samt konverteringar mellan rektangulär ``(real, "
"imag)``\\ - och polär ``(r, phi)``\\ -representation."

#: ../../library/cmath.rst:13
msgid "Functions"
msgstr "Funktioner"

#: ../../library/cmath.rst:17
msgid "Return the cosine of ``z``."
msgstr "Returnerar cosinus av ``z``\\ ."

#: ../../library/cmath.rst:21
msgid "Return the exponential of ``z``."
msgstr "Returnerar exponentialfunktionen av ``z``\\ ."

#: ../../library/cmath.rst:25
msgid ""
"Return the natural logarithm of ``z``.  The branch cut is along the negative"
" real axis."
msgstr ""
"Returnerar den naturliga logaritmen av ``z``\\ .  Förgreningssnittet ligger "
"längs den negativa reella axeln."

#: ../../library/cmath.rst:29
msgid ""
"Return the base-10 logarithm of ``z``.  The branch cut is along the negative"
" real axis."
msgstr ""
"Returnerar 10-logaritmen av ``z``\\ .  Förgreningssnittet ligger längs den "
"negativa reella axeln."

#: ../../library/cmath.rst:33
msgid "Returns the phase of the number ``z``, in the range (-pi, +pi]."
msgstr "Returnerar fasen för talet ``z``\\ , i intervallet (-pi, +pi]."

#: ../../library/cmath.rst:37
msgid "Returns, as a tuple, the polar form of ``z``."
msgstr "Returnerar, som en tupel, polärformen av ``z``\\ ."

#: ../../library/cmath.rst:41
msgid "Returns the complex number with modulus ``r`` and phase ``phi``."
msgstr ""
"Returnerar det komplexa talet med absolutbeloppet ``r`` och fasen ``phi``\\ "
"."

#: ../../library/cmath.rst:45
msgid "Return the sine of ``z``."
msgstr "Returnerar sinus av ``z``\\ ."

#: ../../library/cmath.rst:49
msgid "Return the square-root of ``z``."
msgstr "Returnerar kvadratroten av ``z``\\ ."

#: ../../library/cmath.rst:52
msgid "Constants"
msgstr "Konstanter"

#: ../../library/cmath.rst:57
msgid "Base of the natural logarithm"
msgstr "Basen för den naturliga logaritmen"

#: ../../library/cmath.rst:62
msgid "The ratio of a circle's circumference to its diameter"
msgstr "Förhållandet mellan en cirkels omkrets och dess diameter"
